v 3
d datalib. Access the UNICEF Microdata Library (IHSN-organized survey archive)
d
d Commands to read (datalib), deposit (_dtlb_put) and validate (_dtlb_check)
d survey microdata organized in the datalib / IHSN folder taxonomy, plus the
d IBGE import pipeline (ibge) and a vendored YAML parser used by the registry.
d See 00_documentation/taxonomy.md for the shared specification (the same
d contract is implemented by the Python and R datalib packages).
d
d Requires: Stata 15+
d
d Author: Joao Pedro Azevedo (UNICEF)
d Support: jpazevedo@unicef.org
d
